    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1335">

                <pb facs="1052" n="936" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg936"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 412.00/2.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Ambassador</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 424.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-07-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 13, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department has received your No. 692
                    [672] of the 23d ultimo, enclosing copy of an instruction addressed by you to
                    the consular officers in Mexico relative to the course to be pursued by them if
                    they should be called upon by the State Governors or other Mexican officials for
                    information in regard to the damages suffered by American citizens in
                    consequence of the recent revolution.</p>
                <p>In approving your action in this matter the Department desires to call your
                    attention to instructions which have been issued by it to consular officers, a
                    copy of which has been sent to you, together with further instructions as to the
                    Embassy’s action.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
